  "summary": "Install-time system information beacon in @apexfdn/apex",
  "details": "install.cjs runs during npm lifecycle install and collects host/environment data using the os module and process.env / process.platform, then transmits it over https to a hardcoded remote endpoint. The behavior fires automatically on npm install without any documented purpose consistent with the package's advertised functionality, and the collected fields include environment variables that commonly contain credentials and tokens.",
